OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss funds phone-free
OL,4,Ameasures at 30 schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fhas named 30 schools where he will fund
OL,8,Fmeasures to store pupils' phones during
OL,9,Fthe day.
OL,11,FSecondary schools in Berkshire,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire and Oxfordshire will be
OL,13,Fgiven money for solutions such as
OL,14,Flockers or phone pouches.
OL,16,FA #255,000 fund was announced in June
OL,17,Fby Thames Valley PCC Matthew Barber,
OL,18,Fwho said the measures would reduce the
OL,19,Frisk of crimes such as anti-social
OL,20,Fbehaviour and exploitation.
