OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss funds phone-free
OL,4,Ameasures at 30 schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban on smartphones in schools in
OL,7,FEngland came into force on 29 June,
OL,8,Fmaking individual schools and trusts
OL,9,Flegally responsible for being
OL,10,Fphone-free throughout the day.
